  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "e16ba764-b917-41c0-aca3-8b8c8d159e58",
      "title": "Olhe a cena, escute o áudio e confirme o sentido da palavra nova.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "23181450-b9c9-4cb7-bcab-af162577eba4",
          "textContent": "<p>Olhe a imagem e escute a frase.</p><p><strong>Ella es sociable.</strong></p><p>Em português: Ela é sociável.</p><p><strong>sociable</strong> = sociável</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/83cae5c9555341948d3c1446d4f0eb27_b01-ella-es-sociable.png?Expires=1794099419&Signature=mSfWg-HRSsQKcLMHoGi~1tpiY6FOrtQmUoxd~r94J6M9O5rcFvY9Xz6W-XRDss4xDWnm10IeTOnuEWZfcpjhezVWJicOMyb1ETBIn8iMKkUdP7~vjXa~wPbyOzlqNUX5awy5UPY0hOerkhqIZ6~B8rGJirEmfV1g~rTc8rRRldMdOmfLWcEg2yzJ8bj3hhUKJGhzebkf61n~kQtthIOX8Pk8GJCZPQ5DtaynbpwtzMceQPd95e7hoyAAC81oSkjnYQMynXfRwKcq0f2g2KFqrwMbL7uDoT-KJTKss5LXUXW-4iuwnKqnCKr9p8GG3zKhHQHMNZwrj0ikvP~a1k4X4w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
