    {
      "id": "ab7a7cb2-594e-47c0-b0dc-f39bcfe6066f",
      "title": "Leia os exemplos e imagine a energia que essa pessoa transmite.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "7e60be9d-cbe7-42e4-aa3f-df7df7dd5af6",
          "textContent": "<p>Use <strong>alegre</strong> para falar de alguém com uma presença leve e positiva.</p><ul><li><strong>Paula es alegre.</strong></li><li><strong>Mi hermana es alegre.</strong></li></ul><p>Ao ler as frases, imagine alguém que sorri com facilidade e anima o ambiente.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1c87733d-3034-412e-9f46-dd5dc85394cb",
      "title": "Olhe a cena, escute o áudio e associe a palavra a essa qualidade.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "4d9b0488-0fdd-4d39-9e94-355b1840e949",
          "textContent": "<p>Olhe a imagem e escute a frase.</p><p><strong>Ella es inteligente.</strong></p><p>Em português: Ela é inteligente.</p><p><strong>inteligente</strong> = inteligente</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/f1bc30de3078447295f9794210c9caf6_b05-ella-es-inteligente.png?Expires=1794099419&Signature=ii3VvpvhHNt~2Uq74psLWnkI0BcYYKzyrniSbWHN~K7xjVmcWErOgkLk5f-fwEDNQf8Uxo5Q3teGkfpbkFZcB90jwVCq2qrk98Wpahh5RCSmphlTEFLC6olopvCPZuahiBMvmD45X~BV-Y4xBfEgNov~kd0P1apooJl~T50VSvFBwzJEAhkYQKiJp~FvIBMU88ZMhU0tLIFMB3d7-vUtaNBCSmIBT7wJdPvfLH6luhnjxGEP05NADGH42nvIXYj3yf1L-WcE8m77Qwao9tfl3BYMf-4h5wkOWepAqRl7HG~w~PcT5xZnZXShzWCrUbQpHpsaR8iYz6evZGkcmSVsZQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/6047c663704f41c88a7424e00fbfd429_b05-ella-es-inteligente.mp3?Expires=1794099419&Signature=jqtIzKchpVKpPlkL-373hrrIzUJk68tC146-N8wi6Q-VRT1B1JhKkyrYr928YMN8zs5nIHgzZARXFGbD4wPk-Rq2CDVUwwu62IvbvTgquU-aYgAOh8W0zvITSLlrHTNYr-mke3f4FhvmhyG5kqjeAvMIBUQQ6TrJVWWpHqWrs9~1ZtXjqJsdjWJJyr~yM7ZkQAM0Y2Hc0XYqm-W1IF~mIKnrSM051edoRbdWMU92rrWcPFWsOKvs9IRfgdkuymI2-HYuQIPmFtXpW5ndBikS9TaaiCbn70rH44BgsYNOMBlvX4lVR90mk06sp04Z7dlQfl49BLPgEwtRRx-tWE8-Jw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
